{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《香港01》迎來成立十周年的重要里程碑，於9月3日（星期四）假灣仔香港會議展覽中心盛大舉行10周年慶典酒會及晚宴。現場政商界名流及娛樂圈半壁江山均獲邀出席，盛況空前、陣容鼎盛！</p><figure><img alt=\"《香港01》創辦人于品海與古天樂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172581586978213888597631.jpeg/s0Rvzq1mGxvbKMQ_mIAsxoRth6NMwgIk42KAXeNigF0\"/><figcaption>《香港01》創辦人于品海與古天樂。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張敬軒。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172580493582143488457120.jpeg/6WS0uttNZfx1myOfqNIppLqRkgXb37zSqZaD0KmWg9A\"/><figcaption>張敬軒。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"佘詩曼！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172580487604998144163295.jpeg/hyIrLSWUJbp0E-oEtzh_sCVa5J12eDV-HqDEXh6gxF4\"/><figcaption>佘詩曼！</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"天后楊千嬅、《香港01》行政總裁蘇曉婷、丁子高。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172580879235551232751204.jpeg/j7laEDNHmpb1svFnqM2yQmsQOdRIm3fR1Hn6ldR5-pU\"/><figcaption>天后楊千嬅、《香港01》行政總裁蘇曉婷、丁子高。</figcaption></figure><p>演藝界巨星星光熠熠</p><p>今次十周年慶典場面極具規模，多位影壇及電視界重量級人馬親臨現場祝賀。當中包括古天樂率領朱鑑然、胡子彤、陳苡臻到賀，雙料視后佘詩曼、天后楊千嬅與丈夫丁子高以及歌王張敬軒亦同場現身，為《香港01》送上真摯祝福。此外，曾比特（Mike）、鄧小巧、泳兒、林奕匡、陳慧敏、小肥、海兒、Viva、趙浚承、田啟文、龔慈恩、車婉婉、林盛斌（Bob）、麥玲玲、葉念琛、唐安麒、伍允龍、陳家樂、湯怡、何佩瑜（Jeana）、唐詩詠、許家傑、關嘉敏、莊子璇、宋苑穎、孫慧雪、HOY TV首席內容官Cora 嚴嘉念、歐倩怡、向海嵐、李藴、甄詠珊、羅浩銘、劉洋等多位圈中重磅人物亦親臨現場，全場星光璀璨。</p><figure><img alt=\"張敬軒、《香港01》行政總裁蘇曉婷以及《香港01》創辦人于品海。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172581999006060544872053.jpeg/-Qz8uEPD9-2glHA67NU72nhuft7it1xG1nG9stZxvbI\"/><figcaption>張敬軒、《香港01》行政總裁蘇曉婷以及《香港01》創辦人于品海。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古天樂上台分享。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172581996376100864628109.jpeg/L_7WpClS014qk8LAxEpRQGVjRu3djAXITdUyY03VMmM\"/><figcaption>古天樂上台分享。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古天樂率領朱鑑然、胡子彤、陳苡臻到賀。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172581992890503168270685.jpeg/yniXcwbbmH5W2tUKP2fjj5yxrq4pHm9PLqBaIy6gWiM\"/><figcaption>古天樂率領朱鑑然、胡子彤、陳苡臻到賀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"許惠菁、佘詩曼。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172594801179103232058372.jpeg/dolnjrHN50A0IuVc5SrxC9phDpj-M1T7UWsneVFrJ3k\"/><figcaption>許惠菁、佘詩曼。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林盛斌（Bob）、麥玲玲和陳志雲。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172585417828995072024519.jpeg/46R3WVzAeJnLD6augKS8CAwZs5hn-76l20X2SttF9ko\"/><figcaption>林盛斌（Bob）、麥玲玲和陳志雲。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《中年樂聲音》陣容。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172592184172482560681950.jpeg/SC7DLfe3_KVgmyDDYA_9W-uuxgluLbwdtbofyLW6H8g\"/><figcaption>《中年樂聲音》陣容。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電影監製田啟文。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172606446139871232485921.jpeg/ca_hr36abPYSPML7VrONIVlr-NyKP3dxXrcIA163CAM\"/><figcaption>電影監製田啟文。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172587321993072640490287.jpeg/pBZNmPe2KcFHgbULur_zFr6Wj_Sg0IiegTq5pIE6uaQ\"/><figcaption>鍾培生。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"海兒。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172587319442804736042935.jpeg/CwblvXSkCpnb_r_KoKm3mWNze9DXtTLYSC1DJEgtQyQ\"/><figcaption>海兒。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"泳兒。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172587316817039360531097.jpeg/XHHFgWpnefcb5fM5_aIe-ThvSgu-j80gKWxwsSlscLE\"/><figcaption>泳兒。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾比特（Mike）。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172587314044473344695703.jpeg/NN-ndeqFlh1brfQtWapYbTzgoKZ74V7F8qFBVPKhQVQ\"/><figcaption>曾比特（Mike）。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孫慧雪上台分享。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172592587932962816678319.jpeg/pHyf7KAz5nNXvbtrXlN9DKOTHy7rJEXxWc4qJFnOKiQ\"/><figcaption>孫慧雪上台分享。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HOY TV陣容！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172586610760355840497586.jpeg/mhzgJk-oBeBPozAaYV5qJy77ScV8NH35pB4KCaQeCgk\"/><figcaption>HOY TV陣容！</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"銀河映像藝人包括車婉婉、徐浩昌（肥腸）、龔慈恩、CEO朱淑儀及蘇家樂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172589361342976000430768.jpeg/FZ9lChf3kuE9uwLahe4Po_FGq7jf6AA8zt3Pic7dz4k\"/><figcaption>銀河映像藝人包括車婉婉、徐浩昌（肥腸）、龔慈恩、CEO朱淑儀及蘇家樂。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"壹意娛樂文化旗下四位藝人歐倩怡（Cindy）、李蘊（Renee）、甄詠珊（Carisa）及美女廚師鄭紫欣（Kobe），昨晚（3日）結伴盛裝出席《香港01》十周年慶祝酒會。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172581602920763392780964.jpeg/7Kv5pJAKDIufVzII9By9GZkUuFgvJkgM--4u_fvuLv0\"/><figcaption>壹意娛樂文化旗下四位藝人歐倩怡（Cindy）、李蘊（Renee）、甄詠珊（Carisa）及美女廚師鄭紫欣（Kobe），昨晚（3日）結伴盛裝出席《香港01》十周年慶祝酒會。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳嘉寶、何嘉莉。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172590278758895616407351.jpeg/9j9jeeWmPbTcRu9TsFvDJjJjSEluaHB2k6MouZOjKLk\"/><figcaption>陳嘉寶、何嘉莉。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐詩詠。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172595601460695040014352.jpeg/UZcp9CHaINobiwYXpxuFwQ4g5Xoaqme-Xp5nNV6eZzU\"/><figcaption>唐詩詠。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唐安麒。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172583906843561984479802.jpeg/6hx7XJN21e8UgSPy3GsHf0p8COG5aO0DYqHcBmKh3AY\"/><figcaption>唐安麒。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"即將升任人父的歌手伍富橋（Alvin）以及太太Shirley。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172596299237822464854239.jpeg/gJgEKYihCu-OZI8ui8rPuqMpJT4JOJ0XCd3G6wndxus\"/><figcaption>即將升任人父的歌手伍富橋（Alvin）以及太太Shirley。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉晨芝、小肥。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172596296335233024359104.jpeg/C7W4jzBRM6zwWdixwzx2JOwVxPtOmv07d37ZK3d-2Ss\"/><figcaption>劉晨芝、小肥。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭紹康、葉念琛、KOL小斯。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172584823081144320829173.jpeg/OelPYyYw7Mf9PrhocJ-dYLKtFgYXOEmxaLWuWGi1rlg\"/><figcaption>鄭紹康、葉念琛、KOL小斯。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172584820342132736456173.jpeg/aNcvCAM6Hh9Y-bWB2wiUqf8nhUFpwfXfZb13NWW9dzU\"/><figure><img alt=\"梁敏巧、曾錦燊。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172584817531817984738941.jpeg/H9ex2ty0uPFjM6nxrMh2PTt4BNnJPqe4VNRQf1TUUH8\"/><figcaption>梁敏巧、曾錦燊。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T10:20:02.871667+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":797,"images":27,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}